# leakscan allowlist (see tcvr/docs/LeakScan.md).
# One Perl regex per line, matched against the reported value, or `path:<glob>` to skip a file.
# Keep this short: every entry is a hole. Prefer `leakscan:allow` on the single line instead.

# Bot identities used by upstream CI workflows.
^github-actions@github\.com$
^41898282\+github-actions\[bot\]@users\.noreply\.github\.com$

# The scanner's own self-test uses fake sample values on purpose.
path:tcvr/tools/leakscan/tests/**
